{"id":"n31735-3-8","stage":1,"title":"접다 · 折起","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n31735-3-8-1","ko":"이 우산은 어떻게 하지요?","zh":"这把伞怎么放？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"우산은","meaning":"雨伞","explanation":"우산：雨伞；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"우산","audio":"/audio/8b6f9142a49be5004b82.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71103","senseId":"1","lemma":"우산","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하지요?","meaning":"办理，处置，分配","explanation":"하다：办理，处置，分配；지요：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"13","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"8b6f9142a49be500","term":"우산","zh":"雨伞","audio":"/audio/8b6f9142a49be5004b82.mp3","entryId":"71103","definition":"在长竿上铺上像遮盖物一样的膜，下雨时用手举着遮雨的工具。","pronunciation":["우ː산"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"办理，处置，分配","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"处理事情或问题。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/869c95d96c8035c0b232.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n31735-3-8-2","ko":"잘 접어서 이 통에 넣어 두세요.","zh":"收好后放在这个桶里。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"잘","meaning":"好好地，顺利地","explanation":"잘：好好地，顺利地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"4","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"접어서","meaning":"折起，收回，收拢","explanation":"접다：折起，收回，收拢；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"접다","audio":"/audio/5f4ea7801b30aa44c714.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31735","senseId":"3","lemma":"접다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"통에","meaning":"桶","explanation":"통：桶；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"통","audio":"/audio/837d5d028930fb39e15f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71293","senseId":"1","lemma":"통","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"넣어","meaning":"放进，装进","explanation":"넣다：放进，装进；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"넣다","audio":"/audio/c0bd6058bd724000a75e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64509","senseId":"1","lemma":"넣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"두세요.","meaning":"搁，放置，摆放","explanation":"두다：搁，放置，摆放；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"두다","audio":"/audio/531b2c3977c491e8379e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67470","senseId":"1","lemma":"두다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"好好地，顺利地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"没有任何问题而舒服地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"5f4ea7801b30aa44","term":"접다","zh":"折起，收回，收拢","audio":"/audio/5f4ea7801b30aa44c714.mp3","entryId":"31735","definition":"将展开的东西叠成原来的样子。","pronunciation":["접따"]},{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"